    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a platitude. \"new paths\" and \"healing\"... people say that when they dont understand how fundamental this was. it wasnt just a job or a hobby, it was my entire reason for being. like, if the core of me is gone, what am i supposed to \"heal\"? there is no version of me that makes sense anymore. it's like looking at a house that's been burned to the ground and being told to just... decorate the ashes? it's just empty. everything is just empty.",
